<h3>Expert recommendations</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Buy the sofa before you paint the walls.</strong> Match the paint to the sofa fabric, never the other way around.</li>
  <li><strong>Book a warm-white bulb test.</strong> Before signing off on any lighting plan, request warm 2700K bulbs installed in every fixture. See the actual mood before it's too late to change.</li>
  <li><strong>Invest in one bespoke piece.</strong> A custom credenza or headboard in solid walnut with a story becomes the piece guests always comment on.</li>
  <li><strong>Trust factory-direct for modular, retail for decor.</strong> The best value is a factory workshop for wardrobes, kitchen, TV unit — and curated retail for lamps, textiles, plants.</li>
  <li><strong>Under-buy at first.</strong> It's easier to add a piece 6 months later than to remove one after it's arrived.</li>
</ul>
